### Login
# @name login
POST http://localhost:40000/Login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "user1",
    "password": "1234"
}

###

@token = {{login.response.body.$.token}}

### Cadastrar animal
# @name novoAnimal
POST http://localhost:40000/insertAnimal
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "nome": "Bovino 001",
    "datanasc": "2024-05-12"
}

###

@animalId = {{novoAnimal.response.body.$.id}}

### Listar animais
GET http://localhost:40000/getAllAnimais
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Buscar animal
GET http://localhost:40000/getAnimalByID/{{animalId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Atualizar animal
PUT http://localhost:40000/updateAnimal/{{animalId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "nome": "Bovino 001 Atualizado",
    "datanasc": "2024-05-12"
}

###

### Excluir animal logicamente
DELETE http://localhost:40000/deleteAnimal/{{animalId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}